[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5025955395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5025955395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5025955395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK5H-Qw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T18:49:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T18:49:17Z","body":"I don't think this is a bug, GDScript doesn't allow passing `null` to `String` as it's a null object specifically, see [here](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#null)\n\nI don't think the fact that Java supports this is relevant here","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5025955395/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5026875629","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5026875629","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5026875629,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK6AI7Q","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T20:17:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T20:17:56Z","body":"First, to be clear about the layer: `Uri.parse(null)` isn't a `var s: String = null` assignment in GDScript — it's a Variant `NIL` passed as a *method argument*, which `JavaClassWrapper` marshals to Java. The GDScript typing rules for `null` don't govern that boundary; the wrapper's argument marshalling does.\n\nObject arguments already accept a Java `null` (since #96182). In Java, `String`, arrays, and `CharSequence` are nullable references in exactly the same way, and `null` is a meaningful argument for them in common APIs (see `ContentResolver.query` below). So shouldn't they be handled the same way?\n<!-- And at that boundary, Godot has already decided that passing a Java `null` through the wrapper is valid: #96182 (\"Android: Fix `JavaClassWrapper` so it actually works\") added `!= Variant::NIL` so that **object arguments accept `null` and pass it to Java as `null`**. My point is just that the same should hold for the other nullable argument types — a Java `String`, `String[]`, or `CharSequence` is a nullable reference like any other object, so if an object argument can take `null`, these should be able to as well. -->\n\n`ContentResolver.query(Uri uri, String[] projection, String selection, String[] selectionArgs, String sortOrder)`\n- `projection = null` -> **return all columns** (an empty `String[]` means *no columns* — the opposite)\n- `selection = null` -> **all rows** (no WHERE clause)\n\nThis is the standard Android DB read and is designed around passing `null`; through `JavaClassWrapper` you currently can't express it. Same for `SharedPreferences.getString(key, null)` (a `null` default is how you detect \"key not set\" — `\"\"` can't distinguish unset from empty) and `ContentResolver.update/delete(..., null, ...)`. And `Uri.parse(String)` (single signature) has no non-null overload to fall back on at all.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5026875629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5026938361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5026938361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5026938361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK6D9-Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T20:25:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T20:25:25Z","body":"I don't think that applies as GDScript `null` isn't the same as Java `null`, but I'm not sure how this would be solved while still retaining type safety, does it work with `Variant()` instead of `null`?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5026938361/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027281935","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5027281935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5027281935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK6Y8Dw","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T21:06:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T21:06:26Z","body":"`Variant()` is the same `NIL` as `null` in GDScript, so it wouldn't behave any differently. And since `var s: String = null` is already a parse error, a `null` only reaches the wrapper when I write it explicitly at a dynamic call like `Uri.parse(null)` — the same case object arguments already handle (#96182). Couldn't `String` be handled the same way?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027281935/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027351895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5027351895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5027351895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK6dNVw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T21:14:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T21:14:51Z","body":"CC @dsnopek ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027351895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5031736388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5031736388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5031736388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK-o0RA","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T08:23:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T08:23:17Z","body":"I had suggested removing this limitation, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111135#issuecomment-3361899142\nWe should discuss this again. I'd also like to remove this limitation.\n\nThis is an advance API and I guess we can expect these users to handle null safety on their own.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5031736388/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5032831289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5032831289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5032831289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK_rpOQ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T10:24:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T10:24:20Z","body":"If this is preventing folks from calling Java/Kotlin API's correctly (like, passing `null` for a `String` argument is the only way to do something) then I think we need to allow this.\n\nI haven't tested this, but I suspect we'd simply need to change this code:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7220d456dcf116ae5499505a237b449c0b00cfce/platform/android/java_class_wrapper.cpp#L107-L112\n\n... to:\n\n```c++\n\t\t\t\tcase ARG_TYPE_STRING:\n\t\t\t\tcase ARG_TYPE_CHARSEQUENCE: {\n\t\t\t\t\tif (!p_args[i]->is_string() && !p_args[i]->is_null()) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\targ_expected = Variant::STRING;\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t} break;\n```\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5032831289/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5053846716","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5053846716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5053846716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLTuUvA","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T03:03:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T03:03:38Z","body":"If `String` arguments allow `null` values, shouldn't other nullable types (such as `CharSequence`, `Dictionary`,  `Callable` and array) also allow `null` values?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5053846716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5058380148","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5058380148","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5058380148,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLYDBdA","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T12:28:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T12:28:49Z","body":"Yeah, we should probably allow null for everything that is nullable. Which I think is everything except primitive types in Java, right?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5058380148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5058461438","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5058461438","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5058461438,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLYH-_g","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T12:37:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T12:37:35Z","body":"Yes, with the exception of primitive types, reference types—including arrays—allow null values.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5058461438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5061751649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121576#issuecomment-5061751649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121576","id":5061751649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLbQzYQ","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T18:07:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T18:23:45Z","body":"The comment I made in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111135#issuecomment-3361899142 still stands so I'm closing this as intended behavior.\n\nEDIT: re-reading the description, the current limitation is indeed a blocker.\n\n> Yeah, we should probably allow null for everything that is nullable. Which I think is everything except primitive types in Java, right?\n\nHowever allowing null for everything that is nullable is not the right approach as this would cause runtime crashes when invoking kotlin libraries that don't accept null values. So another approach needs to be investigated.\n\nRe-opening the issue to allow further discussions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5061751649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]